; Test that a non-kernel with only a flat to LDS cast is lowered through the
; base table, and that every kernel reaching it gets a kernel ID.
; @k1 reaches @writer through @mid. @k2 has no LDS and gets a null base entry.
; amdgpu-no-lds-kernel-id must be removed from @mid and @writer.

@lds = internal addrspace(3) global [4 x i32] poison, align 4

;.
